/us/bloomberg-reporter-barred-from-trump-xi-putin-meeting-after-question-on-former-nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang/articleshow/135994045.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bloomberg-reporter-barred-from-trump-xi-putin-meeting-after-question-on-former-nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang/articleshow/135994045.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T19:15:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135994186,imgsize-729551.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[James Packer sells Aspen mansion for $42.7 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135992953.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Australian billionaire James Packer has successfully offloaded his opulent Aspen mansion for $42.7 million, a staggering return on his 2013 investment of $15.6 million. The breathtaking Tuscan-inspired estate has been acquired by tech entrepreneur Alex Davis and his wife, Lindsay, who are no strangers to the Aspen community. With Packer having moved on from the U.S.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/australian-billionaire-james-packer-sells-his-aspen-mansion-for-42-7-million-about-27-million-more-than-he-and-ex-wife-erica-paid-in-2013-for-the-seven-bedroom-home-with-a-waterslide/articleshow/135992953.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/australian-billionaire-james-packer-sells-his-aspen-mansion-for-42-7-million-about-27-million-more-than-he-and-ex-wife-erica-paid-in-2013-for-the-seven-bedroom-home-with-a-waterslide/articleshow/135992953.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T18:58:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Real Estate Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135993167,imgsize-343246.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[H-1B-hater Bo French expelled from an exclusive club for his racist remarks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135993331.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/h-1b-hater-bo-french-expelled-from-an-exclusive-club-for-his-racist-remarks-he-says-he-didnt-make-any-offensive-comment-members-have-slept-with-others-spouses-have-you-asked-them-to-resign/articleshow/135993331.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/h-1b-hater-bo-french-expelled-from-an-exclusive-club-for-his-racist-remarks-he-says-he-didnt-make-any-offensive-comment-members-have-slept-with-others-spouses-have-you-asked-them-to-resign/articleshow/135993331.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T18:52:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135993377,imgsize-41330.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Canadian condo owner loses case over neighbours’ scented laundry after claiming smell kept her off balcony since 2018]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135991801.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In British Columbia, a woman's legal complaint against her neighbors' scented laundry products was dismissed after the strata council's investigation failed to pinpoint the odor's source. The tribunal ruled that the fragrances did not amount to a nuisance, underlining the difficulties residents face when addressing such grievances in condo living situations, where personal spaces can sometimes clash.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-bc-condo-owner-who-said-her-neighbours-scented-laundry-kept-her-off-her-balcony-since-2018-has-lost-her-case-after-a-tribunal-ruled-laundry-smells-come-from-a-reasonable-lawful-everyday-activity/articleshow/135991801.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-bc-condo-owner-who-said-her-neighbours-scented-laundry-kept-her-off-her-balcony-since-2018-has-lost-her-case-after-a-tribunal-ruled-laundry-smells-come-from-a-reasonable-lawful-everyday-activity/articleshow/135991801.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T18:20:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135992308,imgsize-955232.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[London professor loses £80,000 claim over neighbour's role in flat sale dispute]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135985343.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-london-professor-claimed-his-neighbour-made-his-680000-flat-unsellable-by-revealing-past-property-disputes-to-a-buyer-he-lost-his-80000-claim-and-faced-a-180000-legal-bill/articleshow/135985343.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-london-professor-claimed-his-neighbour-made-his-680000-flat-unsellable-by-revealing-past-property-disputes-to-a-buyer-he-lost-his-80000-claim-and-faced-a-180000-legal-bill/articleshow/135985343.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T20:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135985499,imgsize-171256.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[82-year-old Arkansas man loses appeal over sale of family's 331 acres after 30 years living there]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135982467.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[William J Cooper, an 82-year-old resident, faced significant hurdles in selling his family's inherited land as ordered by the court. Although he sought a physical division to continue living there, the Arkansas Court of Appeals ultimately deemed his appeal moot after the property was sold to a third party. This case highlights the complex challenges heirs may encounter in property disputes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-82-year-old-arkansas-man-lived-on-his-familys-331-acres-for-over-30-years-but-relatives-sought-a-sale-an-appeals-court-later-dismissed-his-challenge/articleshow/135982467.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-82-year-old-arkansas-man-lived-on-his-familys-331-acres-for-over-30-years-but-relatives-sought-a-sale-an-appeals-court-later-dismissed-his-challenge/articleshow/135982467.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T15:58:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135982617,imgsize-2333395.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[UK refinery worker uses ChatGPT to fight £100 parking fine for three years, wins case before court]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135989725.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Rafal Goral, a dedicated refinery worker from Chelmsford, has emerged victorious against a parking fine that plagued him for three years. The fine stemmed from a brief 16-minute delay in payment at a Newquay car park. With the invaluable help of ChatGPT, Goral crafted compelling arguments for his case, ultimately leading the parking company to drop the charges just before a court hearing.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-45-year-old-refinery-worker-from-chelmsford-essex-used-chatgpt-to-answer-every-letter-in-a-three-year-fight-over-a-100-newquay-parking-fine-that-rose-to-about-300-and-the-company-dropped-the-case-before-court/articleshow/135989725.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-45-year-old-refinery-worker-from-chelmsford-essex-used-chatgpt-to-answer-every-letter-in-a-three-year-fight-over-a-100-newquay-parking-fine-that-rose-to-about-300-and-the-company-dropped-the-case-before-court/articleshow/135989725.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-19T17:20:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135990077,imgsize-477170.cms"/></item></channel></rss>